WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Draft: review the items and total, then select Confirm order.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
In progress: confirmation reserves the two units. Mark shipped advances the whole order; Cancel order releases reservations.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Shipped: stock has left on hand and reservations are cleared. Returns are now available.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Completed: select Mark completed after fulfilment. You can still record returned items.

